exports[`ServiceCard — snapshot > matches the snapshot (card with bullets, image left) 1`] = `"<!--\\n  Dumb presentational component for a single service card on the /servicios page.\\n  All content comes via props spread by apps/web/src/pages/servicios.astro\\n  from SERVICIOS_PAGE_CONTENT.services (with the layout-only imagePosition\\n  prop added per card for the alternating layout). The component never fetches\\n  or mutates data (frontend-standards: \\"Frontmatter sin lógica de negocio no\\n  trivial\\").\\n\\n  Layout (design.md Decisions):\\n    - Root element: flat white surface with a 1px border, no rounded corners,\\n      no shadow (flat design). Flex column on mobile (image stacked on top),\\n      flex row side-by-side from md+. imagePosition === 'right' adds the\\n      md:flex-row-reverse utility so the image sits on the right (cards 02, 04).\\n    - Image: astro:assets (sharp-processed WebP/AVIF), full-width on mobile,\\n      half-width from md+, aspect-[4/3] object-cover, lazy-loaded.\\n     - Content block: sector label (text-primary uppercase), two-digit number\\n       badge (text-primary), h2 title (text-secondary),\\n       optional intro paragraph (text-text-2, the only prose block, above bullets),\\n       optional bullets (ul + decorative lucide:check icon), optional tags (pills\\n       with border border-border), and the accent CTA.\\n    - CTA: solid bg-accent button linking to /contacto with a decorative\\n      lucide:arrow-right icon (aria-hidden).\\n\\n  Tokens: bg-white, border-border, text-primary, text-secondary, text-text-2,\\n  bg-accent / bg-accent-dark. Strict flat design — no rounded-* and no shadow-*\\n  in the static state.\\n--><article class=\\"bg-white border border-border flex flex-col md:flex-row overflow-hidden\\"><img src=\\"/_image?href=%2F%40fs<PROJECT_ROOT>%2Fsrc%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fmedidores-de-agua.webp%3ForigWidth%3D1024%26origHeight%3D682%26origFormat%3Dwebp&amp;w=1024&amp;h=682&amp;f=webp\\" srcset=\\"/_image?href=%2F%40fs<PROJECT_ROOT>%2Fsrc%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fmedidores-de-agua.webp%3ForigWidth%3D1024%26origHeight%3D682%26origFormat%3Dwebp&amp;w=400&amp;h=266&amp;f=webp 400w, /_image?href=%2F%40fs<PROJECT_ROOT>%2Fsrc%2Fassets%2Fimg%2Fmedidores-de-agua.webp%3ForigWidth%3D1024%26origHeight%3D682%26origFormat%3Dwebp&amp;w=800&amp;h=533&amp;f=webp 800w\\" data-image-component=\\"true\\" alt=\\"Medidores de agua instalados en infraestructura industrial\\" sizes=\\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"1024\\" height=\\"682\\" class=\\"w-full md:w-1/2 aspect-[4/3] object-cover\\"><div class=\\"flex-1 p-6 md:p-10 flex flex-col\\"><span class=\\"text-primary font-heading uppercase text-xs tracking-wide\\">SECTOR INDUSTRIAL</span><span class=\\"text-primary font-heading font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-2\\">02</span><h2 class=\\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-secondary mt-4\\">Medición Industrial</h2><p class=\\"mt-3 text-base font-body text-text-2\\">Ofrecemos soluciones especializadas para la medición de caudal en procesos industriales, asegurando eficiencia y control en cada etapa. Nuestro servicio abarca:</p><ul class=\\"mt-4 space-y-2\\"><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><symbol id=\\"ai:lucide:check\\"><path fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" stroke-width=\\"2\\" d=\\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\\"/></symbol><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Instalación de medidores de flujo para líquidos, gases y vapor.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Configuración, calibración y puesta en marcha de equipos.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Integración con sistemas de monitoreo y control en plantas industriales.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Capacitación y soporte técnico para la correcta operación de los dispositivos.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Profesionales en el área de obra, eléctrica y automatización.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Servicio de soporte técnico para ajustes, calibraciones y resolución de problemas.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Asesoría postventa.</span></li><li class=\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-text-2 font-body\\"><svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:check\\"><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:check\\"></use></svg><span>Capacitación para el personal encargado del monitoreo y control de los equipos.</span></li></ul><a href=\\"/contacto\\" class=\\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark text-white font-heading font-semibold uppercase text-sm px-6 py-3 transition-colors self-start\\">CONTACTAR A UN ESPECIALISTA<svg width=\\"1em\\" height=\\"1em\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"h-4 w-4\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-icon=\\"lucide:arrow-right\\"><symbol id=\\"ai:lucide:arrow-right\\"><path fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\" stroke-width=\\"2\\" d=\\"M5 12h14m-7-7l7 7l-7 7\\"/></symbol><use href=\\"#ai:lucide:arrow-right\\"></use></svg></a></div></article>"`;

